Q('Easy', 'Rectangle Struct', 'Struct with Area and Perimeter methods. | Input: w h. | Output: "area perimeter".', lambda s: '%d %d' % (iv(s)[0] * iv(s)[1], 2 * sum(iv(s))), [L('3 4')], two(1, 30))
